@@ -11,6 +11,10 @@ daily price in euro cents, then use `quote` or `book` with UTC midnight ISO-8601
 timestamps. Rental periods are half-open: the end is the start of the day after the final rental
 day. `book` rejects any overlap for the same item; adjacent periods are allowed.
 
+Use `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to list the sorted ids of equipment that is free for the
+entire half-open period. Omit `kind` to include both boards and sails; otherwise it must be `board`
+or `sail`.
+
 Cancellation is intentionally not part of this first API. The school policy is retained for the
 future cancellation feature: cancellations at least 24 hours before the booking start receive the
 full amount; later cancellations receive no refund.
